This repository contains four skills that are copied unchanged from the
SolidCraft project (https://github.com/tangency-labs/solidcraft, version 0.24.0,
commit 9cba66c14d38d17504d0c3efb9e04194435743b7, folder `skills/`):

  skills/solidcraft-modeling
  skills/solidcraft-editing
  skills/solidcraft-checking
  skills/solidcraft-mechanisms

